SUMMARY:11th World Congress on Women's Mental Health 2027
DESCRIPTION:The 11th World Congress on Women's Mental Health is organized
  by the International Association for Women's Mental Health and hosted b
 y the Women and Mental Health working group of the Catalan Society of Ps
 ychiatry and Mental Health. The theme is integrating a biopsychosocial a
 pproach in women's mental health\, with oral presentations\, posters\, s
 ymposia and workshops.\n\nDeadlines\nAbstract submission opens: 2026-02-
 15\nSymposium and workshop submission: 2026-09-30\nOral and poster abstr
 act submission: 2026-10-30\nUndergraduate student submission: 2026-12-23
  (estimated)\n\nhttps://iawmh2027.org/
LOCATION:Sitges\, Catalonia\, ES\, Hotel Meliá Sitges
URL:https://iawmh2027.org/
